{{/*
  Tuna config — assembled by chezmoi from .chezmoitemplates/tuna/{catalogs,bindings,settings}.

  - Edit `.chezmoitemplates/tuna/catalogs`  to change catalog global scopes.
  - Edit `.chezmoitemplates/tuna/bindings`  to change combo-mode bindings.
  - Edit `.chezmoitemplates/tuna/settings`  to change hotkeys, theme, or the
    clipboard-history shortcut.

  Drift caught by `,doctor-tuna` (and `chezmoi diff`) after Tuna rewrites the
  deployed file. Backport via `chezmoi merge ~/.config/tuna/config.toml` (or
  copy the changed lines into the relevant fragment by hand).

  COUPLED: run_before_backup-tuna-config.sh.tmpl re-derives this file's content
  by concatenating the same three fragments with a newline between each, to
  hash it without a re-entrant chezmoi call. Change how this template
  assembles them and that hash stops matching, which makes the guard warn on
  every apply. Update both together.
*/ -}}
{{ template "tuna/catalogs" . }}
{{ template "tuna/bindings" . }}
{{ template "tuna/settings" . -}}
